<p>Hai qaid abide beemar kya qayamat hai<br />
nahi hai koi madadgaar kya qayamat hai</p>

<p>Hai dasto paae mubaarak me bhaari zanjeerei'n <br />
Gale me touqe giraa'n baar kya qayamat hai</p>

<p>Bandhe hai haath rasan me hai god me bache <br />
wo tez oonto'n ki raftaar kya qayamat hai</p>

<p>Pade hai laashe azeezo'n ke garm rethi par<br />
hai qaid waarise ghamqaar kya qayamat hai</p>

<p>Sakina qaid me baba ko jab bhi roti hai<br />
layee'n ghurakte hia har baar kya qayamat hai</p>

<p>Bitha ke oontho'n pa syedaaniyo'n kko be parda<br />
phiraae koocha o baazaar kya qayamat hai</p>

<p>Yazeed baitha hai taqte tilaa pa aye mazhar<br />
khade hai aabide beemaar kya qayamat hai<br />
</p>